          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p></p><p>Kim Gravel is a widely successful entrepreneur, television personality, author, podcaster, life coach, and a former Miss Georgia. You may have seen her on one of her number-one shows on QVC or bought a product from her Belle by Kim Gravel fashion line or Love Who You Are beauty and jewelry. </p><p>But what’s most important is not what she’s doing but who she’s being.</p><p>A woman committed to her God-given calling, which is building up women everywhere and helping them to Love Who They Are.</p><p>In fact, this is so important to her, she’s created an entire movement and business around it.</p>"
