            "text": "The Love Who You Are Movement",
            "heading_tag": "h1"
          }
        },
        "richtext_wPUWFK": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>You are not broken. You don’t need fixing.</p><p>You are beautiful, unique, one-of-a-kind, strong, smart, and loved. </p><p>And if you’ve forgotten that, it’s because life is hard. But it’s time for you to remember, and that’s what the Love Who You Are movement is all about.</p><p>It’s time to start where you are to become the woman you are meant to become. It’s not going to be easy, but it WILL be the most important thing you ever do.</p><p>You’ve got this. I believe in you.</p><p>Xoxo Kim</p>"
